  "notes": "{付|つ}く is an intransitive godan verb meaning something attaches or sticks by itself.\n\nTRANSITIVITY:\n- ⟦{自動詞|じどうし}→自動詞：10977_jidoushi⟧ (intransitive): {付|つ}く - something attaches\n- ⟦{他動詞|たどうし}→他動詞：10418_tadoushi⟧ (transitive): ⟦{付|つ}ける→付ける：00761_tsukeru⟧ - to attach something\n\nASPECT (ている):\n{付|つ}いて⟦いる→いる：00495_iru⟧ indicates a resulting state: \"is attached/stuck.\"\n\nCOMMON EXPRESSIONS:\n- ⟦{気|き}→気：02199_ki⟧⟦が→が：00051_ga⟧{付|つ}く: to notice, become aware\n- ⟦{身|み}→身：01764_mi⟧⟦に→に：00314_ni⟧{付|つ}く: to acquire (a skill), to learn\n- ⟦{運|うん}→運：02143_un⟧⟦が→が：00051_ga⟧{付|つ}く: to be lucky\n- ⟦{嘘|うそ}→嘘：01796_uso⟧⟦が→が：00051_ga⟧{付|つ}く: to lie (different kanji: ⟦{嘘|うそ}→嘘：01796_uso⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧⟦つく→つく：noentry⟧)\n- 〜⟦{付|つ}き→付き：26333_tsuki⟧: with 〜 included (⟦{朝食|ちょうしょく}→朝食：03122_choushoku⟧{付|つ}き = with breakfast)",
